class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5" href="#In_Food_Processing" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_5" data-source="" data-orig="In Food Processing">In Food Processing</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6" href="#In_Household_Cooking" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_6" data-source="" data-orig="In Household Cooking">In Household Cooking</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#In_Baking" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_7" data-source="" data-orig="In Baking">In Baking</span></a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#Where_to_Buy_Potato_Flakes_Powder" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_8" data-source="" data-orig="Where to Buy Potato Flakes Powder">Where to Buy Potato Flakes Powder</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#How_to_Choose_Good_Potato_Flakes" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_9" data-source="" data-orig="How to Choose Good Potato Flakes">How to Choose Good Potato Flakes</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10" href="#Price_of_Potato_Flakes_Powder" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_10" data-source="" data-orig="Price of Potato Flakes Powder">Price of Potato Flakes Powder</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-11" href="#Potato_Flakes_Manufacturers" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_11" data-source="" data-orig="Potato Flakes Manufacturers">Potato Flakes Manufacturers</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-12" href="#Packaging_of_Potato_Flakes" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_12" data-source="" data-orig="Packaging of Potato Flakes">Packaging of Potato Flakes</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-13" href="#Are_Potato_Flakes_Starch_Flour_and_Mashed_Potato_Powder_the_Same" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_13" data-source="" data-orig="Are Potato Flakes">Are Potato Flakes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_14" data-source="" data-orig="Starch">Starch</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_15" data-source="" data-orig="Flour">Flour</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_16" data-source="" data-orig="and Mashed Potato Powder the Same">and Mashed Potato Powder the Same</span>?</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_Are_Potato_Flakes"></span><strong>¿Qué son las hojuelas de patata??</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><a href="/es/product/dinweys-bulk-potato-flakes/">hojuelas de patata</a> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="are dehydrated potato products made by removing the water content from fresh potatoes while retaining their nutrients">are dehydrated potato products made by removing the water content from fresh potatoes while retaining their nutrients</span>. Esto da como resultado piezas en forma de escamas., convirtiéndolos en un ingrediente clave en las industrias de procesamiento de alimentos y panificación..</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_Are_Potato_Flakes_Made"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="How Are Potato Flakes Made">How Are Potato Flakes Made</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes are typically produced in large industrial facilities">Potato flakes are typically produced in large industrial facilities</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="as small factories cannot achieve the same level of quality">as small factories cannot achieve the same level of quality</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="The production process involves several steps">The production process involves several steps</span>:</p><ol><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="Fresh potatoes are washed">Fresh potatoes are washed</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="peeled">peeled</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="and selected">and selected</span>.</li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="They are steamed and mashed">They are steamed and mashed</span>.</li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="The mashed potatoes are then dried into large flakes using a drum dryer">The mashed potatoes are then dried into large flakes using a drum dryer</span>.</li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="These large flakes can be further processed into smaller sizes">These large flakes can be further processed into smaller sizes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="usually between 3mm-6mm">usually between 3mm-6mm</span>.</li></ol><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="It is known as potato flour when ground into a fine powder">It is known as potato flour when ground into a fine powder</span> (100 malla). <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="Note that in some regions">Note that in some regions</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="potato flour refers to starch">potato flour refers to starch</span>.</p><figure id="attachment_415-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-415-2" style="width: 398px" class="wp-caption aligncenter"><img src="/images/potato-flour-300x300.jpg" decoding="async" class="wp-image-415 " alt="potato flour" width="408" height="408" title="¿Qué es el polvo de los copos de papa?wder?Cosas que no debes saberKnow 3" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-415-2" class="wp-caption-text"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="Potato Flour">Potato Flour</span></figcaption></figure><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Types_of_Potato_Flakes"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="Types of Potato Flakes">Types of Potato Flakes</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="There are two main types">There are two main types</span>:</p><ol><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="Large flakes">Large flakes</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="Used in food processing for snacks and fried foods">Used in food processing for snacks and fried foods</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="Finely ground flakes">Finely ground flakes</span> (harina de patata)</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="Commonly used in mashed potatoes and baking">Commonly used in mashed potatoes and baking</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="such as in potato bread and pastries">such as in potato bread and pastries</span>.</li></ol><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="Another related product is">Another related product is</span> <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="potato granules">potato granules</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="made using a different drying method">made using a different drying method</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="spray drying">spray drying</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="often used in similar applications">often used in similar applications</span>.</p><hr /><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Uses_of_Potato_Flakes"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="Uses of Potato Flakes">Uses of Potato Flakes</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="In_Food_Processing"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="In Food Processing">In Food Processing</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes are a key ingredient in many snack foods">Potato flakes are a key ingredient in many snack foods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="especially in making composite chips">especially in making composite chips</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="Their natural flavor and retained nutrients make them a popular addition in the production of puffed snacks and fried foods">Their natural flavor and retained nutrients make them a popular addition in the production of puffed snacks and fried foods</span>.</p><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="In_Household_Cooking"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="In Household Cooking">In Household Cooking</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="At home">At home</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="potato flakes are primarily used to make mashed potatoes or simple baked goods">potato flakes are primarily used to make mashed potatoes or simple baked goods</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="Due to their high water absorption and dispersibility">Due to their high water absorption and dispersibility</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="they can also be used as fish bait">they can also be used as fish bait</span>.</p><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="In_Baking"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="In Baking">In Baking</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="In baking">In baking</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="potato flakes add a unique flavor and contribute to the Maillard reaction">potato flakes add a unique flavor and contribute to the Maillard reaction</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="enhancing the roasted potato taste">enhancing the roasted potato taste</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="While they may not provide the structural stability of wheat flour">While they may not provide the structural stability of wheat flour</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="they significantly improve the taste and nutritional value of baked goods">they significantly improve the taste and nutritional value of baked goods</span>.</p><hr /><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Where_to_Buy_Potato_Flakes_Powder"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="Where to Buy Potato Flakes Powder">Where to Buy Potato Flakes Powder</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="Although edible">Although edible</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="potato flakes are mainly a food processing ingredient and are not widely available in regular markets">potato flakes are mainly a food processing ingredient and are not widely available in regular markets</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="You can purchase them online">You can purchase them online</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Choose_Good_Potato_Flakes"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="How to Choose Good Potato Flakes">How to Choose Good Potato Flakes</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="High-quality potato flakes are free of discoloration or black spots">High-quality potato flakes are free of discoloration or black spots</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="The color">The color</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="whether white or yellow">whether white or yellow</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="doesn&#8217;t affect the quality">doesn&#8217;t affect the quality</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="To assess the quality">To assess the quality</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="you can perform a water absorption test">you can perform a water absorption test</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="high-quality flakes will disperse quickly in warm water">high-quality flakes will disperse quickly in warm water</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="If you&#8217;re an industrial buyer">If you&#8217;re an industrial buyer</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="check the supplier&#8217;s major customers">check the supplier&#8217;s major customers</span>. Por ejemplo, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="some companies supply high-quality potato flakes to brands like Pepsi and Orion">some companies supply high-quality potato flakes to brands like Pepsi and Orion</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Price_of_Potato_Flakes_Powder"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="Price of Potato Flakes Powder">Price of Potato Flakes Powder</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="The price of bulk potato flakes varies between">The price of bulk potato flakes varies between</span> $1.60 &#8211; $2.50 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="USD per kilogram">USD per kilogram</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="depending on quality and origin">depending on quality and origin</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="Prices fluctuate based on potato market conditions">Prices fluctuate based on potato market conditions</span>.</p><hr /><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Potato_Flakes_Manufacturers"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="Potato Flakes Manufacturers">Potato Flakes Manufacturers</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="The leading producers of potato flakes are located in Europe">The leading producers of potato flakes are located in Europe</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="North America">North America</span>, Rusia, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="and China">and China</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="Regional differences in flavor">Regional differences in flavor</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="diet">diet</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="and potato varieties contribute to product variation">and potato varieties contribute to product variation</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Packaging_of_Potato_Flakes"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="Packaging of Potato Flakes">Packaging of Potato Flakes</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="Industrial packaging typically comes in large bags">Industrial packaging typically comes in large bags</span> (20kg, 25kg, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="or 800kg">or 800kg</span>). <span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="Smaller packages are available for home use">Smaller packages are available for home use</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="although they may be labeled differently">although they may be labeled differently</span>.</p><hr /><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Are_Potato_Flakes_Starch_Flour_and_Mashed_Potato_Powder_the_Same"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="Are Potato Flakes">Are Potato Flakes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="Starch">Starch</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="Flour">Flour</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="and Mashed Potato Powder the Same">and Mashed Potato Powder the Same</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul><li><strong>hojuelas de patata</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="are dehydrated potatoes">are dehydrated potatoes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="retaining cellular structure and nutrients">retaining cellular structure and nutrients</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="with a moisture content of around">with a moisture content of around</span> 6%.</li><li><strong>almidón de patata</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_100" data-source="" data-orig="is extracted from broken potato cells and dried to">is extracted from broken potato cells and dried to</span> 10% humedad. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_101" data-source="" data-orig="It&#8217;s used in cooking">It&#8217;s used in cooking</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_102" data-source="" data-orig="food processing">food processing</span>, hornada, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_103" data-source="" data-orig="and industrial applications">and industrial applications</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_104" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flour">Potato flour</span></strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_105" data-source="" data-orig="refers to finely ground potato flakes and is used in mashed potato powder production">refers to finely ground potato flakes and is used in mashed potato powder production</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_106" data-source="" data-orig="Mashed potato powder">Mashed potato powder</span></strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_107" data-source="" data-orig="is similar to potato flour but often contains added ingredients">is similar to potato flour but often contains added ingredients</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_108" data-source="" data-orig="We offer a variety of high-quality potato flakes and potato starch products">We offer a variety of high-quality potato flakes and potato starch products</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_109" data-source="" data-orig="Our team of experts can provide valuable information and recommendations tailored to your specific production needs">Our team of experts can provide valuable information and recommendations tailored to your specific production needs</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_110" data-source="" data-orig="As a supplier to both Pepsi and Orion">As a supplier to both Pepsi and Orion</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_111" data-source="" data-orig="we are committed to consistent product quality and timely delivery">we are committed to consistent product quality and timely delivery</span>.</p><p>Enlaces sobre</p><p><a href="/es/about-us/"><strong><u><b>Descubre más sobre nosotros</b></u></strong></a></p><p><a href="/es/products/"><strong><u><b>Encontrar productos</b></u></strong></a></p><p><a href="/es/contact-us/"><strong><u><b>Contáctenos</b></u></strong></a></p><blockquote class="wp-embedded-content" data-secret="PKF6RacCr6"><p><a href="/es/potato-flakes-and-granules/">Copos y gránulos de patata: Propiedades, Usos, y diferencias</a></p></blockquote><p><iframe data-lazyloaded="1" src="about:blank" class="wp-embedded-content" sandbox="allow-scripts" security="restricted" style="position: absolute; visibility: hidden;" title="&#8220;Copos y gránulos de patata: Propiedades, Usos, y diferencias&#8221; &#8212; Experto en producción de patatas en el norte de China" data-litespeed-src="/es/potato-flakes-and-granules/embed/#?secret=031UG7lxzw#?secret=PKF6RacCr6" data-secret="PKF6RacCr6" width="600" height="338" frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" scrolling="no"></iframe></p><blockquote class="wp-embedded-content" data-secret="s4ZpRbevZL"><p><a href="/es/potato-